# Research Summary & Current Concept

## What We're Building

**Two TypeScript libraries that let developers write Solana programs in TypeScript and deploy them without ever touching Rust.**

### `@solana-kit/program` — Program Builder
Define accounts, errors, events, and instructions. The transpiler converts them to Anchor Rust. Cloud compilation handles `cargo build-sbf`.

### `@solana-kit/sdk` — Client SDK
The same program definition is the typed client. No code generation. No IDL. Programs as plugins.

---

